  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/A1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Fixture (java and kotlin): Svc.run -> java:external:0-0:findAll/save {receiver_type_hint UserRepo, external_owner_ancestors ['JpaRepository']}; no JpaRepository/CrudRepository/springframework.data row in io_primitives*; io-boundaries 0 io edges. Java also still emits the Site-2 fallback `calls Svc.run -> UserRepo:interface (ast_call_inherited_method, 0.7)`; kotlin does not. The unqualified parent (`extends UserRepo -> java:external:0-0:JpaRepository` though the import edge carries the FQN) is the core inheritance-linker mechanism named in WI-fivor, not WI-pivap. Stamp survives #1985 (495f9747f5) and 2e78e70d27. ROOT-CAUSE GROUPS: framework-inherited owner unrowed (with WI-fivor, WI-gokun); inheritance-linker last-segment placeholder (with WI-fivor, WI-ligin). Status unchanged."  # d814
